      <definition>v.t. and i. To trace, follow; to imitate; to appear in rows.</definition>
      <page>549</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠠᠯᠠᠷᠠᠭᠰᠠᠨ ᠪᠢᠴᠢᠭ ᠮᠥᠷᠯᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
